    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="42.5">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> 42.5</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Eac we cweðað, þæt mon mote mid his hlaforde feohtan orwige, gif mon on ðone hlaford fiohte; swa mót se hlaford mid þy men feohtan.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Likewise we declare, that one may fight at the side of his lord without incurring liability if someone fights against his lord; the lord may similarly fight at the side of [his] man.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">We further declare that a man may fight on behalf of his lord, if his lord is attacked, without becoming liable to vendetta. Under similar conditions a lord may fight on behalf of his men.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Eac we cweðaþ, þæt mon mote mid his hlaforde feohtan orwige, gif mon on þone hlaford fiohte; swa mot se hlaford mid þam men feohtan.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
